><span mathquill-command-id=\"129\">(</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"131\">x</var><span mathquill-command-id=\"133\" class=\"mq-binary-operator\">−</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"135\">4</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"137\">)</span><span class=\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\" mathquill-command-id=\"139\"><span class=\"mq-sup\" mathquill-block-id=\"141\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"140\">3</span></span></span></span></div></div>",
      "rendered_text": "−5−7(x−4)−5(x−4)2−136​(x−4)3",
